cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these materials, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "From Cells to Clusters: An Introduction to Single-Cell RNA-seq Analysis in Python"
abstract: >-
  Bilingual (English/Spanish) hands-on tutorial materials for ISCB-LATAM SolBio SPBBC 2026
  (Lima, Peru): Google Colab notebooks and slides covering Cell Ranger outputs, quality control,
  clustering, cell type annotation, visualization, differential expression, enrichment,
  integration and pseudobulk analysis with Scanpy and the scverse ecosystem.
